OL,3,GNEWSADrinks giant Diageo apologises
OL,4,Aafter Moray burn pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Environment Protection
OL,7,FAgency (Sepa) said its investigation
OL,8,Finto the incident remains ongoing and
OL,9,Fenforcement action would be considered
OL,10,Fonce it was complete.
